    "title": "Woman sentenced for attempted murder in brutal Wendy's stabbing - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By WICS/WRSP Staff ,\n1 days ago DANVILLE, Ill. (WICS/WRSP) - A woman has been sentenced for attempted murder after stabbing someone repeatedly in the head at a Danville Wendy’s restaurant. On September 24, 2026, Tichina Marshall pleaded guilty to Attempt First-Degree Murder, a class X felony, and was sentenced to 12 years in the Illinois Department of Corrections. Read full article",
